    "type": "game",
    "name": "Liminal City",
    "steam_appid": 3604260,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Empty streets between soulless buildings\u2026 Structures that feel familiar yet alien\u2026 And the feeling that something is constantly watching you\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604260/extras/8f616bbeb6da963ed43ad4938e9bee6a.poster.avif?t=1752694227\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604260/extras/8f616bbeb6da963ed43ad4938e9bee6a.webm?t=1752694227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604260/extras/8f616bbeb6da963ed43ad4938e9bee6a.mp4?t=1752694227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal City is an exploration-focused psychological horror and liminal space experience in the ultra-realistic VHS style, developed with Unreal Engine 5. As you navigate the relatively &quot;safe&quot; streets of Backrooms Level 11, reality can suddenly shift and you find yourself in unexpected levels. Is there an escape? Or is this your new reality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-Realistic Atmosphere: VHS aesthetics with creepy analog horror details, developed with Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Camera Movements: Realistic camera movements that allow you to experience the first-person perspective in the best way possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Level Transitions: You could be dragged into a different Backrooms level at any unexpected moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological Horror: Every moment you think you're safe, you'll realize something's wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery and Exploration: Secret passages, strange events and anomalies await you in the depths of Level 11.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604260/extras/298deff2073e3cccb663e3625143d5c5.poster.avif?t=1752694227\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604260/extras/298deff2073e3cccb663e3625143d5c5.webm?t=1752694227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604260/extras/298deff2073e3cccb663e3625143d5c5.mp4?t=1752694227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's an unsettling experience without the traditional horror elements. There are no creatures chasing you, no puzzles to solve. Just an ever-changing world to explore. No matter how far you walk, are you really moving forward? Or are you stuck here?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604260/extras/bdc27186b86131f2424eac264c63bec9.poster.avif?t=1752694227\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604260/extras/bdc27186b86131f2424eac264c63bec9.webm?t=1752694227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604260/extras/bdc27186b86131f2424eac264c63bec9.mp4?t=1752694227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The uneasiness in the silence... There is no spooky music or jump scares here. There is only the sound of the void... Sometimes strange humming sounds coming from far away. Your steps echo but sometimes you feel like you hear an extra step. Are you really alone?</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Empty streets between soulless buildings\u2026 Structures that feel familiar yet alien\u2026 And the feeling that something is constantly watching you\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604260/extras/8f616bbeb6da963ed43ad4938e9bee6a.poster.avif?t=1752694227\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604260/extras/8f616bbeb6da963ed43ad4938e9bee6a.webm?t=1752694227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604260/extras/8f616bbeb6da963ed43ad4938e9bee6a.mp4?t=1752694227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal City is an exploration-focused psychological horror and liminal space experience in the ultra-realistic VHS style, developed with Unreal Engine 5. As you navigate the relatively &quot;safe&quot; streets of Backrooms Level 11, reality can suddenly shift and you find yourself in unexpected levels. Is there an escape? Or is this your new reality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-Realistic Atmosphere: VHS aesthetics with creepy analog horror details, developed with Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Camera Movements: Realistic camera movements that allow you to experience the first-person perspective in the best way possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Level Transitions: You could be dragged into a different Backrooms level at any unexpected moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological Horror: Every moment you think you're safe, you'll realize something's wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery and Exploration: Secret passages, strange events and anomalies await you in the depths of Level 11.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604260/extras/298deff2073e3cccb663e3625143d5c5.poster.avif?t=1752694227\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604260/extras/298deff2073e3cccb663e3625143d5c5.webm?t=1752694227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604260/extras/298deff2073e3cccb663e3625143d5c5.mp4?t=1752694227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's an unsettling experience without the traditional horror elements. There are no creatures chasing you, no puzzles to solve. Just an ever-changing world to explore. No matter how far you walk, are you really moving forward? Or are you stuck here?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604260/extras/bdc27186b86131f2424eac264c63bec9.poster.avif?t=1752694227\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604260/extras/bdc27186b86131f2424eac264c63bec9.webm?t=1752694227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604260/extras/bdc27186b86131f2424eac264c63bec9.mp4?t=1752694227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The uneasiness in the silence... There is no spooky music or jump scares here. There is only the sound of the void... Sometimes strange humming sounds coming from far away. Your steps echo but sometimes you feel like you hear an extra step. Are you really alone?</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Liminal City is a psychological horror and exploration game based on found footage, set in Backrooms Level 11. Walk through the streets of Level 11, filled with soulless buildings, dynamically moving to different levels and searching for a way out. Once you fall in here will you be able to get out?",
